# Badgermole Cub: "Whenever you tap a creature for mana, add an additional {G}" is a triggered mana ability of each Cub.
# The first Cub earthbends the Forest (a creature land). Paying for the second Cub taps that creature, which adds {G}
# and one additional {G} from the first Cub. Both earthbend the same Forest, so on turn 3 the Forest taps for {G} plus
# one additional {G} from each Cub: {G}{G}{G}.

